              "call_fc6fc4a49b0548948a16b8dcd40be779",
              "call_30ca6e1690d74bd589fd97d5877a0ad5",
              "call_f5f88be075014ea486d935ef8bfd23f4",
              "call_0271ee34667345b5b9751b883f8abcbb",
              "call_45190be9639444be8529a59e7cc3d564"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B, Qwen3-0.6B-Base and Qwen3-0.6B-FP8 each map to H=1024, I=3072, Q=16 and 28 layers, with tied embeddings. The complete ordinary 0.6B header matches all requested dense weights, including Q [2048,1024], K/V [1024,1024], O [1024,2048] and Q/K norms [128]. Both embedding and lm_head weights exist despite tying being enabled; optional projection biases and EXL3 storage groups are absent, selecting ordinary weights without biases.",
            "basis": "source",
