          },
          {
            "text": "A bounded Python calculation reproduced these six projection layouts and query-heads-per-KV-head ratios 2, 2, 4, 4, 5 and 8. It also showed why explicit D matters: deriving H/Q would yield 64 for 0.6B and 80 for 4B and 32B, rather than their supplied 128. All transcribed linear widths satisfy the existing 128-element padding alignment.",
